# Art sources and baked outputs are binary: never line-ending-normalise, never text-diff.
*.aseprite binary
*.ase binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
# Arena prototype archive (journal Passe A1): the served page is kept byte for byte, never line-ending-normalised.
arena/source/*.html -text

# Embedded fonts (journal Passe UI3): binary; their licences kept byte for byte (their SHA-256 is checked by tests/ui-design.test.mjs).
*.woff2 binary
src/ui/fonts/*.txt -text
